            <p>Just enter your custom URL and API key</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="settings-section">
          <h4>ℹ️ Usage Information</h4>
          <div style="background: #e3f2fd; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #2196f3;">
            <p><strong>Data Privacy:</strong> Your analysis data is sent to the AI service for interpretation. No data is stored by the AI service beyond the request.</p>
            <p><strong>Costs:</strong> AI API usage may incur costs based on your service provider's pricing.</p>
            <p><strong>Offline Mode:</strong> If no API is configured, the system will show a configuration prompt.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
